Source: infiniswap
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: tyong920 <tyong920@gmail.com>
Build-Depends:
 cmake,
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 dh-sequence-dkms,
 libibverbs-dev,
 librdmacm-dev,
 libssl-dev,
 pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/tyong920/Infiniswap

Package: infiniswap-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.8.7), kmod, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: Infiniswap Memory Consumer kernel module source
 Versioned DKMS source for the Infiniswap Memory Consumer. The package builds
 only for the supported Ubuntu Linux 5.15 and 6.8 GA kernel lines and supports
 optional operator-provided module-signing keys.

Package: infiniswap-provider
Architecture: any
Depends: rdma-core, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: infiniswapctl (= ${source:Version})
Description: Infiniswap Memory Provider daemon
 RDMA Memory Provider daemon, hardened systemd unit, default settings, metrics
 and alert integration, and operator documentation. Installation does not start
 the daemon until explicit Provider configuration is present.

Package: infiniswapctl
Architecture: all
Depends: kmod, python3 (>= 3.8), util-linux, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: infiniswap-dkms (= ${source:Version})
Description: Infiniswap administration and release tooling
 Administration commands, versioned JSON schemas, configuration migration,
 capacity-aware Consumer upgrade preparation, Provider rolling upgrades, and
 explicit rollback support. Package actions never create or enable swap.
